      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Actually, I wanted to make a connection\r\nwith the Master Arisen.\r\nI volunteered to be a Clan Steward but it was\r\ndecided a long time ago that those two -Sebastian\r\nand Mary - would be the best choice.",
        "Jp" : "実はね、覚者様との接点がほしくて\r\nクラン執務官に志願してたのよ\r\nだけど、かなり前からあの二人――\r\nセバスチャンとメアリーに決まってたらしくて"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 398283,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
