      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I too have a longing for the Master of the Arisen\r\nand that won't change!\r\nI'll try to be useful in my own way.",
        "Jp" : "私だって覚者様に憧れる気持ちは\r\n変わらないんだから！\r\n私は私なりに、お役に立ってみせるわ"
